      "content": "To meet both the ATS requirement and maintain a genuine tone, weave the values naturally into your experiences. Focus on how your supply chain knowledge drives **Efficiency**, and mention your garden work to subtly tie into **Sustainability**. When discussing teamwork, frame it around **Collaboration** to show you fit the culture. This approach ensures the keywords appear contextually, satisfying the script while still telling your professional story.",
      "source": "target",
